# Evanston Senior Care Guide — what never enters the repository
#
# The rule: a clean clone must build and verify. Anything that is a
# working artefact, a backup, a screenshot, a credential or a throwaway
# test bundle stays out.

# --- credentials. Nothing here is ever committed. ---
.env
.env.*
*.token
*secret*
*credential*
.netlify/

# --- editor / OS / language noise ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- backups taken while editing. The history is the backup. ---
*.bak
*.pre-*
*.orig
*.zip

# --- screenshots and verification images (regenerate them) ---
shots/
brand-desktop.png
brand-hero.png
brand-mobile.png

# --- throwaway test bundles and previews ---
.navtest/
.isotest/
_preview/
in

# --- scratch files from one-off investigations ---
.cites*
.wm.json
.patch_*.py
.audit_*.py
.measure.py
.shot375.py
.overflow.py
.mem*.py

# research scratch from a drafting run
.research/

# push-gate scratch from the 2026-10-23 cloud tests; never again
ACCESS-TEST.md
